WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.127
Week 27: Present Subjunctive: Will and Emotion. recommend and request action express reaction state necessity without overclaiming certainty

2
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:17.929
Cultural lens. Advice, institutional recommendations, and emotional stance in public and private language.

3
00:00:17.929 --> 00:00:30.001
Avoid the single-story trap. Treat country, region, age, relationship, and setting as variables. Describe the evidence you have without turning one example into a universal rule.

4
00:00:30.001 --> 00:00:41.859
Language variation. Recognize regional choices and ask what a form means locally. Use the neutral course model for production until the situation gives you a reason to adapt.

5
00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:50.858
Reflection. Compare this context with one you know. Name one similarity, one difference, and one question that would prevent an assumption.

6
00:00:50.858 --> 00:01:18.417
Model language. Recomiendo que revise los datos. — I recommend that you review the data. Es necesario que participen los vecinos. — It is necessary for the residents to participate. Me alegra que estés aquí. — I am glad you are here. El director pide que lleguemos temprano. — The director asks us to arrive early. Ojalá encuentren una solución justa. — I hope they find a fair solution.

7
00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:28.337
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
